  "title": "CMake: Restrict OSS-Fuzz linker job pool more",
  "description": "2GB is still not enough memory per linker process to prevent OOM\non the OSS-Fuzz build servers. Try 4GB, which is similar to the\nRSS of compiling with clang and ASAN on my machine for a normal\nDebug build (not OSS-Fuzz so not static, so even this may not\nbe enough).\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
